╔P:ergopro-x3 | powered wheelchair
§ domain: medical equipment
§ LPPR = reimbursable products and services list
§ SAV = after-sales service / maintenance

═══ IDENTITY ═══

manufacturer: MobilTech (Germany)
category: powered wheelchair, indoor/outdoor
target_user: reduced mobility, daily use
LPPR: yes

═══ SPECIFICATIONS ═══

frame: steel + aluminum, foldable
weight: 32 kg (with batteries)

.seat_width /number {40 | 42 | 44 | 46 | 48} cm
.seat_depth /number {40 | 42 | 45} cm
.backrest /number {35 to 50} cm {adjustable}
.max_user_weight: 130 kg
.speed /number {0 to 10} km/h {adjustable}
.range: 25 km (standard batteries)
.batteries: 2 x 12V 50Ah gel
.charger: included, 8h full charge
.turning_radius: 80 cm
.controller: joystick, right or left hand

═══ COMPATIBILITY ═══

.cushion >> Varilite, Jay, ROHO, Vicair
.headrest >> Whitmyer, Stealth
.lateral_supports >> Jay, Bodypoint
.elevating_legrests >> included (option)
.tilt_in_space >> not available on this model

═══ USAGE ═══

indoor: yes
outdoor: yes
transport: remove batteries >> fits in adapted vehicle
rain: !attention water-resistant, not waterproof
slopes: max 12% gradient
air_travel: !attention batteries must be disconnected, airline approval needed

═══ ANOMALIES ═══

!critical tilt_in_space not available
  < users needing pressure relief cannot use tilt function
  = must recommend alternative model (ErgoPro X5) for pressure management

!attention battery_replacement [every 18-24 months]
  < gel batteries degrade with charge cycles
  = user must budget for replacement, not covered by initial LPPR

!attention joystick_sensitivity [factory default may be too sensitive]
  < new users may experience abrupt movements
  = technician must adjust sensitivity during first fitting

!attention max_gradient [12%]
  < exceeding gradient risks tipping backward
  = anti-tip wheels mandatory for slopes above 8%

